<title>JAPAN: FUJI TV SHARES FIRST TRADED AT 653,000 YEN ON TSE.</title>
<headline>FUJI TV SHARES FIRST TRADED AT 653,000 YEN ON TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Television Network Inc's shares were first traded at 653,000 yen on the Tokyo Stock Exchange after they were listed on Friday.  </p>
<p>The nationwide broadcaster is a unit of Nippon Broadcasting System Inc . Nippon Broadcasting listed its shares on the TSE's second section in December 1996.</p>
